{"version":1,"content":"<p>2026年11月11日是解放軍空軍成立77周年紀念日。</p><p>2000架無人機11月1日晚上在廣東珠海上空進行燈光表演，拉開一系列紀念活動序幕。</p><p>無人機在夜空呈現「殲-20」、「殲-35A」、「殲-16」等戰機圖案，展現空軍標誌性武器裝備。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T03:00:03.559552+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T02:23:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T00:18:09.718994+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T02:58:08.974110+00:00","content_hash":"9af1c7c9de8691aa0fa73623e067d5d4aac29b40c93aa8c0747bfe8bba84fb99","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}